 "introduction_text": "<div class=\"ql-editor read-mode\"><p>\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Nature Buy Back</strong></p><p>Use this form to log any buy-back transactions from Nature. Please fill in the item details, date, and amount owed accurately.</p><p><br></p><p>\u2713 Purchased item name </p><p>\u2713 Date of transaction </p><p>\u2713 Amount they owe </p><p>\u2713 Attach the receipt </p><p>\u2713 Add any additional notes if needed</p><p><br></p><p>\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Note:</strong> Receipt upload is recommended for all buy-back entries to ensure proper record-keeping.</p></div>",
